## 20262.0.0 (June 2026)

* Update SDK to 20262.0.0
* Add `VizQLDataServiceClient.with_headers(...)` for obtaining a client clone
  that sends additional HTTP headers on every request without mutating the
  original client.
* Add a workbook-datasource-id example flow to the SDK examples runner. When
  the new `--workbook-datasource-id`, `--global-session-header`, and
  `--x-session-id` CLI flags are all supplied, the runner executes an
  additional set of queries against a workbook datasource using the
  `Global-Session-Header` and `X-Session-Id` HTTP headers.

